      "source": [
        "## Deep Q-Learning with Atari Games using RL Baselines3 Zoo\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Install RL-Baselines3 Zoo and its dependencies\n",
        "2. Create a virtual display\n",
        "3. Train our Deep Q-Learning Agent to Play Space Invaders\n",
        "4. Evaluate the agent"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Tv0ZpFDlu5dk"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 1. Install RL-Baselines3 Zoo and its dependencies"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "W2L6Ew_Owb3j"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "c8M_33d9u21i",
        "outputId": "9bee7b63-ef6a-4dcd-a9e0-67e3fe581b93"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
